erDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s428vH2","author":{"login":"janus"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"@vijaydasmp  Happy to have you here.\r\n\r\nCheck any of these:\r\n1) miner_tests.cpp \r\n2) transaction_tests \r\n\r\nThey may look overwhelming but they would help you understand the inner workings of BTC/BGL.\r\n\r\n","createdAt":"2021-09-17T15:34:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-921891318","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s5Fg_iF","author":{"login":"gitcoinbot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Issue Status: 1. Open 2. **Started** 3. Submitted 4. Done \n\n<hr>\n\n__The funding of 100.0 USDT  (100.00 USD @ $1.0/USDT) attached to this issue has been **cancelled** by the bounty submitter__\n\n \n* Questions? Checkout <a href='https://gitcoin.co/help'>Gitcoin Help</a> or the <a href='https://discord.gg/gitcoin/'>Gitcoin's Discord</a>\n* $3,310,997.77 more funded OSS Work available on the [Gitcoin Issue Explorer](https://gitcoin.co/explorer)","createdAt":"2022-06-25T12:46:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-1166276741","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s7ujPXD","author":{"login":"lustsazeus-lab"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/submit #153","createdAt":"2026-03-05T05:03:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4002215363","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s7zR08S","author":{"login":"allornothingai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"```patch\n--- a/test/lint/lint_ignore_dirs.py\n+++ b/test/lint/lint_ignore_dirs.py\n@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n-SHARED_EXCLUDED_SUBTREES = [\"src/leveldb/\",\n-                 \"src/crc32c/\",\n-                 \"src/secp256k1/\",\n-                 \"src/minisketch/\",\n-                ]\n+SHARED_EXCLUDED_SUBTREES = [\"src/crc32c/\",\n+                            \"src/leveldb/\",\n+                            \"src/minisketch/\",\n+                            \"src/secp256k1/\",\n+                           ]\n\n```\n**Explanation:**\nThis patch sorts the `SHARED_EXCLUDED_SUBTREES` list alphabetically in `test/lint/lint_ignore_dirs.py`. This is a minor refactoring to improve readability and maintainability, aligning with the \"Refactoring and simplification\" objective of the bounty hunt. Sorting the list makes it easier to scan and check for existing or missing entries.\n\n**EVM Wallet for Payout:** 0x0c67cbE9e30c66267975eE2D74Eb88036CA65e9F\n**Solana Wallet for Payout:** 3hLpMvUUS685bZz2PzR6vWeA37UrdKq924s7yLMB47eZ\n**XRPL Wallet for Payout:** 0x0c67cbE9e30c66267975eE2D74Eb88036CA65e9F (EVM Sidechain)","createdAt":"2026-03-18T10:53:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"LAUGH","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4081536786","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCTjdXA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #160 for this bounty: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/160`n`nIt fixes stale project documentation links, including the Windows build clone URL, the root README documentation link, and BGL support/resource links. I can provide a USDT payout address if the PR is approved.","createdAt":"2026-05-14T10:04:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4449688924","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCTzbvw","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL-focused maintenance PR for this bounty: #161\n\nIt updates inherited GitHub issue templates and the security policy so reporters are no longer directed to Bitcoin Core resources, repositories, or security contacts.","createdAt":"2026-05-14T10:43:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4449950655","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCaECaA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL test maintenance PR for this bounty: #162\n\nIt fixes #143 by removing the obsolete `gettime` unit test that is no longer needed with the current chrono-based time coverage.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T03:02:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4456514152","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCaEeag","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL maintenance PR for this bounty: #163\n\nIt fixes #142 by increasing the default RPC worker thread count from 4 to 16 and updating the documentation to match.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T03:04:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4456521322","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCaerHg","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL docs fix PR for this bounty: #164\n\nIt removes a stale external Transifex link from the README translations section and points contributors to the repository's translation process documentation instead.\n\nValidation:\n- Confirmed `doc/translation_process.md` exists.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T04:39:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4456950558","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCafJcQ","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL docs cleanup PR for this bounty: #165\n\nIt updates the NetBSD build guide to use BGL Core project references and the local descriptor wallet documentation link instead of upstream Bitcoin Core wording/linking.\n\nValidation:\n- Confirmed `doc/descriptors.md` exists.\n- Confirmed no `Bitcoin Core` or upstream `bitcoin/bitcoin` references remain in `doc/build-netbsd.md`.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T04:41:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4456958321","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCafkkg","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL documentation cleanup PR for this bounty: #166\n\nIt fixes stale local path/link references in the FreeBSD build guide, Unix build example, and multisig tutorial.\n\nValidation:\n- Confirmed `doc/descriptors.md` exists.\n- Confirmed the edited files no longer contain the stale path/link patterns.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T04:43:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4456965266","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbXppQ","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL installer/build fix PR for this bounty: #167\n\nIt updates the Windows NSIS installer to register the BGL URI handler instead of the inherited `bitcoin` handler, aligns the icon/open command with the `.exe` executable name, and removes the matching `BGL` registry key on uninstall.\n\nValidation:\n- Compared the handler block with `share/setup-BGL-win.nsi`, which already registers `BGL`.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T07:26:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4457884069","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbYwkA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another BGL release/docs consistency PR for this bounty: #168\n\nIt syncs `doc/man/Makefile` package metadata with the current 0.1.13 release in `configure.ac`, including the release flag.\n\nValidation:\n- Confirmed `configure.ac` defines `_CLIENT_VERSION_BUILD` as `13` and `_CLIENT_VERSION_IS_RELEASE` as `true`.\n- Confirmed no stale `0.1.11` package/version metadata remains in `doc/man/Makefile`.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n\nPayout details if approved:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`","createdAt":"2026-05-15T07:28:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4457902224","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbaYdw","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another PR for this bounty: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/169\n\nThis fixes the BGL config generator so it writes `share/examples/BGL.conf`, documents the correct script name, and calls the existing `BGLD` variable instead of the undefined `BITCOIND` variable.\n\nPayout:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y","createdAt":"2026-05-15T07:32:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4457928823","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbiLmw","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another PR for this bounty: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/170\n\nThis updates release/package/docs references from `bitcoin.conf` / `gen-bitcoin-conf.sh` to `BGL.conf` / `gen-BGL-conf.sh` in the Guix packaging comments, release checklist, and ZMQ guide.\n\nPayout:\n- PayPal: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina\n- USDT TRC20: TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y","createdAt":"2026-05-15T07:53:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4458056603","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbjc6A","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused cleanup PR for the bounty:\n\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/171\n\nThis fixes the util test runner and remaining util test cases to use the BGL binary names (`BGL-util` / `BGL-tx`) instead of stale Bitcoin names.\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2V