dates user-facing runtime/help text that still pointed users to Bitcoin Core binaries, replacing those hints with `BGLd` and `BGL-cli` where appropriate.\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y` if preferred.","createdAt":"2026-05-15T08:06:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4458117321","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbmsTA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused PR for the bounty:\n\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/175\n\nThis updates contrib tracing/message-capture usage examples and script usage text to point to `BGLd` instead of Bitcoin Core binary names, so the examples work with Bitgesell builds.\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y` if preferred.","createdAt":"2026-05-15T08:09:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4458130508","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbnM1Q","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused PR for the bounty:\n\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/176\n\nThis updates the signet miner helper so it defaults to `BGL-cli`, matching the rest of the Bitgesell signet tooling.\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y` if preferred.","createdAt":"2026-05-15T08:11:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4458138837","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCbn2Cg","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused PR for the bounty:\n\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/177\n\nThis fixes the Qt startup error hint so it points users to `BGL-qt -h` instead of `bitcoin-qt -h`.\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y` if preferred.","createdAt":"2026-05-15T08:13:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4458149386","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCiXZxA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused cleanup PR for this bounty:\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/179\n\nThis updates the root `.gitignore` to match current Bitgesell build artifacts: `src/qt/BGL-qt`, `BGL-Qt.app`, `src/qt/test/test_BGL-qt`, and `test_BGL.coverage/`, replacing stale Bitcoin Core artifact names.\n\nVerification:\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git check-ignore -v src/qt/BGL-qt BGL-Qt.app src/qt/test/test_BGL-qt test_BGL.coverage/`\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y` if preferred.","createdAt":"2026-05-16T02:45:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4465220036","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCiXwFQ","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused build/release cleanup PR for this bounty:\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/180\n\nThis fixes the Darwin Guix codesigning script to target `dist/BGL-Qt.app`, matching the current `OSX_APP=BGL-Qt.app` bundle name from `Makefile.am`, instead of the stale upstream `Bitcoin-Qt.app` path.\n\nVerification:\n- `git diff --check`\n- checked the codesign target against `Makefile.am`\n- normalized-line-ending shell syntax check with `bash -n`\n\nPayment: PayPal https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina, or USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y` if preferred.","createdAt":"2026-05-16T02:48:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4465225749","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCii-YA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused documentation cleanup PR for this bounty:\n\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/181\n\nThis updates the message-capture documentation to use Bitgesell's current daemon/datadir names (`BGLd`, `~/.BGL/message_capture`) instead of inherited Bitcoin Core paths.\n\nVerification:\n- `git diff --check`\n- `rg -n \"bitcoind|~/.bitcoin\" contrib/message-capture/message-capture-docs.md` returns no matches\n- confirmed `src/common/args.cpp` uses `~/.BGL` as the Unix-like default datadir\n\nPayout preference: USDT TRC20 `TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y`\nPayPal fallback: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina","createdAt":"2026-05-16T03:33:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4465409632","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCipiBQ","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted another focused documentation PR for this bounty:\n\n- https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/182\n\nThis updates `doc/i2p.md` so the I2P guide uses Bitgesell's current project and binary names (`BGL Core`, `BGLd`, `BGL-cli`) instead of inherited Bitcoin Core examples.\n\nVerification:\n- `git diff --check`\n- `rg -n \"Bitcoin Core|bitcoind|bitcoin-cli\" doc/i2p.md` returns no matches\n\nPay