ell/issues/32#issuecomment-4466041230","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCjKCSw","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #222 for bounty #32: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/222\n\nSummary: updates .gitignore to ignore Bitgesell build artifacts instead of leftover upstream Bitcoin artifact names.\n\nVerification:\n- git diff --check -- .gitignore\n- Cross-checked ignored artifact names against Makefile.am, configure.ac, and src/Makefile.qttest.include.\n\nPayout: USDT TRC20 TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y; PayPal fallback: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina","createdAt":"2026-05-16T06:41:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4466049611","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCjKedQ","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #223 for bounty #32: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/223\n\nSummary: updates the GitHub issue templates so bug, GUI, security, and contributor guidance point to Bitgesell resources instead of Bitcoin Core resources.\n\nVerification:\n- git diff --check -- .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug.yml .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/good_first_issue.yml .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/gui_issue.yml\n- Parsed all .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*.yml files with PyYAML.\n- Searched the updated templates for leftover Bitcoin Core issue-routing links and command names.\n\nPayout: USDT TRC20 TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y; PayPal fallback: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina","createdAt":"2026-05-16T06:44:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4466056821","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCjKqRw","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"}