s from Bitgesell's security policy, and points reporters to this repository's private vulnerability reporting flow when available.\n\nVerification:\n- git diff --check -- SECURITY.md\n- Searched SECURITY.md to confirm the old Bitcoin Core email/key references were removed.\n\nPayout: USDT TRC20 TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y; PayPal fallback: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina","createdAt":"2026-05-16T06:49:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4466066667","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCjLgmA","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #227 for bounty #32: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/227\n\nSummary: updates the CI default-datadir guard to create dummy Bitgesell datadir paths instead of Bitcoin paths, and aligns the nearby default-datadir comments with the code.\n\nVerification:\n- git diff --check -- ci/test/03_test_script.sh src/common/args.cpp\n- git show :ci/test/03_test_script.sh | bash -n\n- Cross-checked the CI paths against GetDefaultDataDir() in src/common/args.cpp.\n\nPayout: USDT TRC20 TWupTAoFjxR2VmqUUvzhfmUwXVZR6Kvz1Y; PayPal fallback: https://paypal.me/Jeremytsangchina","createdAt":"2026-05-16T06:51:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4466073752","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABCjL0Yg","author":{"login":"JeremyZeng77"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #228 for bounty #32: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/228\n\nSummary: fixes Windows VERSIONINFO metadata for BGL-cli, BGL-tx, BGL-util, and BGL-wallet so each executable reports its own name instead of another tool's name.\n\nVerification:\n- git diff --check -- src/BGL-cli-res.rc src/BGL-tx-res.rc src/BG