ach { |f| YAML.load_file(f); puts \"valid YAML: #{f}\" }'\npython3 test/lint/lint-tests.py\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nPublic contact for payout coordination after approval:\n\n- YUNBO WANG\n- 3299835829@qq.com\n","createdAt":"2026-05-21T05:31:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4505082015","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABDj9sEQ","author":{"login":"tolga-tom-nook"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR for this bounty/improvement lane:\n\n- PR: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bglutil/pull/4\n- Scope: restores the missing `github.com/bitgesellofficial/bgld` module dependency and refreshed sums so a clean `bglutil` checkout can resolve Bitgesell-specific `bgld/...` imports instead of failing before tests start.\n- Validation: `GOTOOLCHAIN=local go test ./base58 ./bech32 ./gcs ./gcs/builder ./hdkeychain` passed; `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD` clean.\n- Payout address if approved: `0x4a76c7E64C08cF29B59eFC640b4ada97A270d428`\n","createdAt":"2026-05-25T11:47:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4534004753","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABDm-WJw","author":{"login":"tiago918"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted a focused contributor-guide PR for the bounty: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/278","createdAt":"2026-05-25T20:52:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4537161255","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABDpFO7g","author":{"login":"CharlieLZ"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted a focused PR for the Bitgesell JS RPC client under the PR bounty hunt: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/js-bitgesellcore-rpc/pull/4\n\nSummary:\n- fixes batch response obfuscation when a node returns an unmatched response id\n- prevents `TypeError` while preserving existing obfuscation behavior for matched ids\n- adds focused Mocha coverage for matched, unmatched, and mixed batch responses\n\nVerification:\n- focused Mocha regression passed\n- `npm run lint` passed\n- `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD` passed\n\nNo payout details are included here; payment details can be provided privately if the PR is accepted.","createdAt":"2026-05-26T02:39:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4539371246","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABDqyOWg","author":{"login":"g8rr5dg2p7-svg"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted a focused documentation cleanup for this bounty: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/279\n\nScope: updates `doc/cjdns.md` so the CJDNS guide uses BGL Core / Bitgesell wording, `BGL-cli` commands, and the local Tor guide link instead of inherited Bitcoin Core / `bitcoin-cli` references.\n\nVerification:\n- `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD`\n- `rg -n \"Bitcoin Core|Bitcoin network|bitcoin-cli|bitcoind|bitcoin/bitcoin\" doc/cjdns.md` returned no matches\n- `python3 test/lint/lint-tests.py`\n\nPayout details can be provided after maintainer review/approval.","createdAt":"2026-05-26T06:31:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4541156954","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABD7vtjA","author":{"login":"wpggLabs"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Bounty submission: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/290\n\nScope: fixes `contrib/devtools/gen-BGL-conf.sh` so the Bitgesell config generator writes `share/examples/BGL.conf`, parses help from the configured `BGLd` binary instead of undefined/inherited Bitcoin command names, and keeps the matching README/placeholder text aligned.\n\nVerification:\n- `git diff --check`\n- `bash -n` on the LF-normalized script content from this Windows checkout\n- smoke-tested with a fake `BGLd` under a path containing spaces; the generator produced `BGL.conf` with the expected BGL header and no stale `bitcoin.conf` / `gen-bitcoin-conf` text\n\nPayment details can be provided after maintainer approval.","createdAt":"2026-05-27T21:49:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4558941580","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABEQH7mA","author":{"login":"jamilahmadzai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi maintainers, before I start another PR for this bounty, could you confirm whether #32 is still active and payable in 2026?\n\nGitcoin shows the attached 100 USDT funding was cancelled in 2022, while the issue text still says approved PRs may be paid. If it is still active, please confirm the current payout rail, selection/approval criteria, and any contribution areas you would prefer over the existing open submissions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T22:22:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/issues/32#issuecomment-4580309912","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDODx_A7s8AAAABERRtIQ","author":{"login":"wangedmund77-cmyk"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Bounty submission for the PR bounty hunt: https://github.com/BitgesellOfficial/bitgesell/pull/322\n\nScope: fixes `test/lint/lint-files.py` so it passes on the current Bitgesell tree by allowing intentional `BGL` source names and normalizing file modes/shebangs.\n\nValidation: `python3 test/lint/lint-files.py` and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T03:35:33Z","includes